{"unit_id":"recyvan__dsh-model-proxy#card-zh","repo":"recyvan/dsh-model-proxy","commit":"b929c450f2667ce6a533c636284c55ef75309a58","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-proxy（DSH 网页端插件）：按模型 API 域名和代理模式路由请求，让指定模型服务经系统代理、自定义 HTTP/SOCKS 代理或代理链访问，其余请求保持直连。它接入 DSH 的 fetch 请求层，并提供可热更新的设置页和状态诊断。主要功能包括按域名或 provider 选择出口、内置模型域名规则、系统代理及代理链配置、查看路由状态与测试代理。适合需要为不同模型 API 配置网络出口的 DSH 用户。需要可用的代理出口；无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:264-429","lib/core/rules.js:170-209","lib/core/dispatcher.js:61-127"]}
{"unit_id":"recyvan__dsh-model-proxy#card-en","repo":"recyvan/dsh-model-proxy","commit":"b929c450f2667ce6a533c636284c55ef75309a58","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-proxy routes DSH model API requests by domain through system, HTTP/SOCKS, or chained proxies, leaving others direct. Settings update live and show routing status and connectivity. Configure domain or provider rules; proxied traffic needs an available proxy, with no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:264-429","lib/core/rules.js:170-209","lib/core/dispatcher.js:61-127"]}
